WEBVTT

00:02:59.163 --> 00:03:02.730
if he'd had any conception
of what I was trying to describe.

00:03:04.463 --> 00:03:07.263
But maybe he was afraid

00:03:07.297 --> 00:03:12.163
to think about the way his world,
steeped in tradition,

00:03:12.197 --> 00:03:13.997
was on the brink of change.

00:03:14.763 --> 00:03:17.930
It used to be that students
had one professor,

00:03:17.963 --> 00:03:20.430
the one standing
at the front of the lecture hall.

00:03:20.997 --> 00:03:22.430
But increasingly,

00:03:22.463 --> 00:03:27.330
if that professor wasn't a good fit,
students could go online

00:03:27.363 --> 00:03:30.363
and seek out videos from other educators
to help them learn.